#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""In-cluster switchboard daemon + /v1 HTTP API server (Cloud Agents #43 / #34).

Modes (SWITCHBOARD_MODE env var, or the persisted switchboard-mode.json):
  - shadow (default): serves the /v1 routes of bin/cloud_floor.py (`handle_switchboard_v1`) plus
    /v1/mode, /v1/shadow-status and /v1/cloud-sync on port 8080, verifying X-Switchboard-Auth.
    Mints GitHub App tokens from the token-mint service every 25 minutes, applies relayed pane
    state, executes relayed actions against the cluster Switchboard engine and runs
    `engine.run_pass()` every `poll_seconds`, recording planned deliveries.
  Shadow passes fake mutating GitHub calls as success and never forward webhooks: a shadow pass is not a real one.
  - active: deliveries for local panes are queued into `pane_outbox` for the pane-relay.
"""
